{"server":"tw","storyId":"act41side_level_act41side_03_end","groupId":"act41side","stageId":"act41side_03","title":"惶惑與衝動","storyCode":"EA-3","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act41side/level_act41side_03_end.txt","sourceHash":"265c25bcbdb13f2c5b806d9a17fbb23c73e26564d342559af389b4c0cf0aa80f","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"59_g3_dragonsquare_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"哎喲！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陰沉的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是誰——提奧？你不看路的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"抱、抱歉！羅里先生，我想去拉格蘭街碰碰運氣，看能不能買到一點馬鈴薯——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陰沉的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"滾開！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車夫的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"小心！馱獸受驚了！快躲開！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陰沉的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"趕車的，你瘋了嗎？差點撞死我！給我停下來！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陰沉的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"竟然就這樣跑了？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"羅里先生，我……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陰沉的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，哈哈，真是惡有惡報，被撞的竟然是你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陰沉的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走，小子，現在你哪裡也去不了了，跟我去見深池的人，我要把你這個叛徒交給他們，這樣我就有馬鈴薯可以——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陰沉的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不對，不能走大路！萬一這個間諜被其他人搶走……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"男人一把提起男孩的領子，不顧男孩痛苦的呻吟，拖著他走向平日無人經過的小巷深處。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"59_g1_citystreets_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陰沉的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真是奇怪，為什麼還是走不出去？難道我記錯路了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"遙遠的爭吵聲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"別搶！把馬鈴薯還給我！你自己去糧店買，你看那裡還有剩下的……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"遙遠的爭吵聲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"還給我！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陰沉的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有剩下的？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"男人看向聲音傳來的方向，又看了看一條手臂握在自己手裡，幾乎已經不成人形的男孩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陰沉的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快死了……快死了還能從他嘴裡撬出情報嗎？深池的老爺們還願意給我一口吃的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陰沉的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1686_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……叛徒，算你運氣好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"男人甩開孩子那反而抓緊了自己袖口的手，快步跑向聲音傳來的方向。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"好痛……我的腿……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"不行，站不起來……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"艾瑪阿姨……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"擔憂的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1696_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……誰叫我？誰？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"擔憂的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1696_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我已經照你說的做了，我已經做了！不要再來纏著我了——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"艾瑪……阿姨！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"擔憂的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1696_1","isRemote":false,"text":"提奧？你怎麼了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"我被馱獸車撞到了，然後又被人丟到了這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"我不是維多利亞人的間諜，艾瑪阿姨。求你救救我，帶我去找庫林先生，好嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"擔憂的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1696_1","isRemote":false,"text":"維多利亞人……間諜？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"擔憂的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1696_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原來這麼快啊……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"艾瑪阿姨，我好痛，真的好痛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道維多利亞人害了大家，大家都不喜歡我，沒人願意聽我說話，更沒人願意碰我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"可是能不能……至少把庫林先生叫過來，我好痛，而且好冷……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"艾瑪阿姨，等我長大了，我會去找維多利亞人報仇的，我會去幫尼亞爾叔叔……報仇的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"擔憂的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1696_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（深呼吸）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"擔憂的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1696_1","isRemote":false,"text":"提奧，如果死的只有尼亞爾，也許我會幫你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"提奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"艾瑪……阿姨？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"擔憂的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1696_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你只知道尼亞爾死在戰爭裡，可是還有更多人，他們沒上戰場，也死掉了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"擔憂的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1696_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為你們維多利亞人封鎖了商路，直到現在還在封鎖，所有人都在挨餓，包括我，包括……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"擔憂的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1696_1","isRemote":false,"text":"尼亞爾留給我的……我肚子裡的孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"擔憂的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1696_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他也餓死了，被你們維多利亞人活活餓死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"擔憂的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1696_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，找其他人去幫你叫庫林吧。他們不像我，他們都是好人……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"擔憂的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_1696_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……很好很好的好人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_oldwarehouse_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"庫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_1697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"艾瑪，竟然是艾瑪……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"庫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_1697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼她會變成這樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莉吉","speakerId":"avg_4177_brigid_1","isRemote":false,"text":"庫林，我不是想幫她辯解，但那天經過那裡的人，肯定不只她一個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"庫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_1697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，不只她一個……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莉吉","speakerId":"avg_4177_brigid_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我是不是說錯話了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"庫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_1697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，你沒說錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"庫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_1697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你之前還想帶提奧離開，是嗎？你看見什麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莉吉","speakerId":"avg_4177_brigid_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別人欺負他。不是小孩子之間的打打鬧鬧，是大人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"庫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_1697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在第一次看見提奧被欺負的時候就衝上去了，我以為這樣的事情……不會再發生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莉吉","speakerId":"avg_4177_brigid_1","isRemote":false,"text":"實際上……發生過很多次。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莉吉","speakerId":"avg_4177_brigid_1","isRemote":false,"text":"之前我只是一直有種很不好的預感，我覺得提奧不屬於這座城市，納斯爾紗可能容不下他，誰知道……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莉吉","speakerId":"avg_4177_brigid_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"庫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_1697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道了，你走吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莉吉","speakerId":"avg_4177_brigid_1","isRemote":false,"text":"庫林？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"庫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_1697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我說我知道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莉吉","speakerId":"avg_4177_brigid_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"庫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_1697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我說我知道了！走！現在就走！讓我——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"庫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_1697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……一個人待著，好嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莉吉","speakerId":"avg_4177_brigid_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……抱歉。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"鐵匠呆呆地站著，靜謐的四周只剩下火焰的劈啪聲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"庫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_1697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"提奧，我……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"他錯過的事情太多，無法理解的事也太多，已經無力去釐清其中的因果與來龍去脈。\n他只意識到一件事——自己什麼都沒做到。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"庫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_1697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我算什麼英雄？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，你算什麼英雄？"},{"type":"narration","text":"鐵匠環顧四周，工坊內空無一人，唯有巨龍的雕像正用空空如也的眼眶斜睨著他，宛如質疑。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巨龍","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你算什麼英雄？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"庫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_1697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我算……什麼英雄？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巨龍","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"英雄會放任一個每天面對無數敵意的孩子，在時不時對他口吐惡言的人群中東遊西逛？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巨龍","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"英雄會讓糧食在自己鼻子底下運出城，直到城內無糧可吃，還只能向鄰居分發幾顆可憐的馬鈴薯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巨龍","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"英雄會在城內亂成一團時窩在家裡埋頭打鐵，就為了把自己的名字刻在雕像的基座上，滿足那點可憐的虛榮心？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"庫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_1697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"庫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_1697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我……我絕不是為了什麼虛榮，我是為了……為了能用英雄的名號，去……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巨龍","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"去像你當時對涅梅絲說的那樣，“為那些在戰爭中失去了一切的同胞謀取幸福”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巨龍","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"就像現在？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"庫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_1697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……就像……現在？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巨龍","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你要保護的弱小已經不在人世。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巨龍","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你要伸張的正義，已經沒入黑暗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巨龍","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你要為之謀取福利的同胞……艾瑪、羅里，他們真的還是你的同胞嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巨龍","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他們難道不是活在過去的死人嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"庫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_1697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"活在過去的……死人？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巨龍","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他們甚至不像你，你那顆虛榮的心還夢想著未來，而他們？他們不過是一群活在過去的行屍走肉罷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巨龍","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你的同胞是個拿著從火裡搶出來的古董刀四處比劃的可憐人嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巨龍","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"或者，為了一個流產的胎兒，就對一個無辜的孩子見死不救的走私犯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巨龍","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"又或者，面對變故，已經只能理解仇恨這一種邏輯的“城裡人”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巨龍","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"現在就抓一個人過來，問問他以後的打算，猜猜看你能聽見什麼？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"鐵匠從不離手的大錘噹啷一聲落在地上。\n他死死盯著巨龍的頭顱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"庫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_1697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"庫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_1697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真正把人們困在過去的……難道不是你嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"庫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_1697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我收集同胞們生活用的碗盆，點燃同胞們取暖照明用的燃料……就只為了哺育你這個……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"庫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_1697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怪物。"},{"type":"narration","text":"糧食我不知道，但金屬、燃料……\n對，是我，我親手把鍋，把碗，把人們的生活餵到你的嘴裡，把你餵成如此巨大……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"庫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_1697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"連我自己的生活也被你吞吃下去，緊接著，就是提奧的生命……"},{"type":"narration","text":"提奧，提奧……\n對，是我養大了這個怪物，這個怪物又把你的命吞掉！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"庫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_1697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在，它又要在夏末節那天站上廣場，張開雙翼，它說整座城的居民都會被它變成只能活在過去的死人……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巨龍","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"庫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_1697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怪物，你說得對。我的確不是英雄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"庫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_1697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是個可憐的、虛榮的騙子。過去我騙其他人，現在，我騙的是自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"庫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_1697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但人們需要我。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巨龍","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"需要你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"庫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_1697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們需要一個英雄，去叫醒他們，告訴他們，戰爭已經結束了，現在重要的是明天，是未來，是即將開始的生活。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巨龍","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"就憑你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"庫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_1697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就憑我。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"鐵匠決絕地自爐膛邊離開。他拿了一條最粗大、最堅固的鐵索，又拖著鐵索，回到巨龍那仍然斜睨著他的頭顱下方。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"庫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_1697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"跟我走。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巨龍","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"去哪裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"庫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_1697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"廣場。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巨龍","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"今天並不是夏末節。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"庫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_1697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不能再等了，再等下去，你那些不祥的預言只會成真。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"庫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_1697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"跟我走……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"庫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_1697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然後，我會將你拆掉……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"庫林","speakerId":"avg_npc_1697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會讓你把生活還給所有人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"巨龍紋絲不動，但鐵匠分明看到，那頭顱向著他低了低，既像輕蔑，又像邀請。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"59_g10_indoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莉吉","speakerId":"avg_4177_brigid_1","isRemote":false,"text":"葦草、涅梅絲，我回來了。庫林的狀態很不好，也許你們應該過去看看他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莉吉","speakerId":"avg_4177_brigid_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們那邊的情況呢？城裡人怎麼樣了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1694_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人們仍然在抓間諜……維多利亞間諜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莉吉","speakerId":"avg_4177_brigid_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們瘋了！說到底，塔拉人、維多利亞人，不都是人嗎？戰爭已經結束了，我們難道還要這樣繼續拚個你死我活嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莉吉","speakerId":"avg_4177_brigid_1","isRemote":false,"text":"涅梅絲，去解釋給人們聽，讓他們吃不到飯的深池已經被紅龍懲治了，糧食也——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"布莉吉，別再說深池這個詞，一次也別說。這是領袖的命令。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且……說到底，糧食的事，我也只是在慶功會上聽見他們竊竊私語罷了，沒有證明，沒有審判。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"甚至連糧食到底是怎麼回來的，我都一無所知。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"更別說深——那些人不在了的消息，現在根本就沒傳到人們的耳裡……我到底該怎麼解釋？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莉吉","speakerId":"avg_4177_brigid_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1694_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果道理講不通，就只能硬來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您是說？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1694_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我回到這裡，原本抱著再也不當影子的打算。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1694_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但到了現在這個地步，如果真正的領袖始終不願露面承擔責任，我就必須出面，至少暫時安撫混亂的人心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1694_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，那位庫林先生呢？他畢竟是公認的英雄，如果他能幫我們一把，事情就能順利許多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他應該就在自己的工坊，我來帶路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"布莉吉，你趁現在快點出城。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莉吉","speakerId":"avg_4177_brigid_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你……如果我們和庫林都無法成功，你和人群之間……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莉吉","speakerId":"avg_4177_brigid_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我懂了，因為城裡的人不喜歡我，我可能會礙事，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，布莉吉，我不是說你礙事的意思——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莉吉","speakerId":"avg_4177_brigid_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但你說得對，我就是會礙事啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莉吉","speakerId":"avg_4177_brigid_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別擔心，我現在就走，去黑林碰碰運氣。也許它現在就願意放行了呢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"59_g1_citystreets_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"庫林！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"庫林……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1694_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他不在嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1694_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"兩人瞠目結舌。\n工坊的門……\n不，工坊正對著她們的那面牆，已經不在了。\n那面本該在雕像完工時才拆掉的牆此時已經化為一堆瓦礫，而那些瓦礫掩蓋不住的，是一道通向廣場方向的拖痕。\n一道寬如道路的，長長的拖痕。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
